20:["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-6 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground sm:text-lg","children":"IC3 Fast Track is a digital literacy skills assessment that can be used to gauge the skill set of incoming students or job candidates. Based on the globally recognised IC3 Digital Literacy Certification, it helps assess an individual's ability to perform in any environment where the use of technology is required. Fast Track is available on the GMetrix learning platform."}]
